  "content": "\n\n<p>我老是忘了在這裡放了這個資源包，請前往 Modrinth 尋找最新版本。:p&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fvisual-potions-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\">modrinth.com/resourcepack/visual-potions-effects</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這是一款簡單的資源包，會為藥水、潑灑型藥水、停留型藥水和藥水箭顯示對應的狀態圖示。它也會顯示物品名稱，讓圖示的整體配色更為協調。</p>\n<p>此外也為瓶裝經驗、河豚和金蘋果新增了圖示。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果我遺漏了任何能賦予藥水效果的物品，歡迎告訴我，我會盡快補上。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cQuOVb8c/images/bfbcdff62ca77825e71d48e36eb870ae47f1a817.png\" alt=\"All languages\" width=\"684\" height=\"615\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/46/ax9o.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"240\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/46/klmw.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"664\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/46/tu0o.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"422\"></p>",
